## Test environment note (Milestone 2 parallel build)

Milestone 2 builds `buffer`, `utf8`, and `scan` in parallel; `commonmark/src/buffer/` does not exist in this worker's tree, and `commonmark/assign/neon.txt` restricts writes to `src/utf8/`.
To compile and run `src/utf8/checks/check_utf8.npk` without writing outside `src/utf8/`, `src/utf8/` was copied to `/tmp/cm_utf8_test/src/utf8/` alongside a temporary contract-conforming stub `/tmp/cm_utf8_test/src/buffer/cm_buffer.npk` (with `buffer_new` temporarily renamed to `cm_buf_new` in the `/tmp` test copy because `buffer_new` is a Nitpick builtin — see `src/utf8/notes.md`). `src/utf8/cm_utf8.npk` itself was NOT modified and does not import `buffer_new`.

## 1. Contract check harness (`src/utf8/checks/check_utf8.npk`)

